\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Fin Min: RBNZ Clearly Felt Criteria For  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Met   \b0\par\par\uc2 198 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 2007\par 08:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Finance Minister Michael Cullen said Monday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market earlier in the day because it felt all criteria for such action had been met.   \par \par \uc2 Cullen also cautioned that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a reminder to investors to desist from overinvesting in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "Today's action is a reminder to people if they overinvest in the New Zealand dollar they could suffer losses," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Earlier Monday the RBNZ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, sending the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  slumping 1.5% to US$0.7510. At 0608 GMT it was at US$0.7511.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in March 1985 - was done by the RBNZ as it viewed the Kiwi's level "as exceptional and unjustified in terms of the economic fundamentals."   \par \par \uc2 Cullen said: "The bank is exercising its powers in accordance with the legislation and the policy targets agreement."   \par \par \uc2 -By Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 11-06-07 0614GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070611e36b0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
