\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-RBNZ to keep OCR, ready for  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 551 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 2005\par 22:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds detail, quotes, background)  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, Nov 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it will keep its official cash rate as its main monetary policy tool, and is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if a global flu pandemic disrupts trading on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.  \par \par \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand Governor Alan Bollard said the official cash rate, a benchmark rate at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades with retail banks, would remain as its main method of keeping inflation in check, despite losing some of its effectiveness.  \par \par \uc2 "We're quite clear the OCR will remain the core tool of monetary policy for the forseeable future," Bollard said at a briefing on the bank's financial stability report.  \par \par \uc2 Last week, the RBNZ and the Treasury said they were looking at new tools to lessen reliance on the official cash rate.  \par \par \uc2 "But they may amount to nothing at all, (and) they're never likely to be more than ancillary," Bollard said.  \par \par \uc2 The cash rate, instituted in 1999, has lost potency with more borrowers taking up fixed-term loans, which have delayed and lessened the impact of any moves in cash rates.  \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ last month resumed its tightening cycle, raising the cash rate to 7 percent -- the highest in the developed world -- to counter stubborn inflationary pressures from the hot housing market and high oil prices.  \par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll has all 15 forecasters surveyed expecting the cash rate to be raised again on Dec. 8 by a quarter point.  \par \par \uc2 READY FOR PANDEMIC  \par \par \uc2 Bollard refused to comment on how monetary policy might be conducted if there was a global bird flu pandemic, but said the RBNZ was planning to ensure key financial systems would keep operating.  \par \par \uc2 Deputy governor Adrain Orr said the RBNZ was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if birdflu hit.  \par \par \uc2 "We'll be making sure ... that our foreign reserves will be poised and ready if the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets become dysfunctional and we have to be providing some type of price making role through that," Orr said.  \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ had been speaking to other central banks on the issue, but there was little concern at this stage.  \par \par \uc2 The financial stability report echoed the comments in the May report about unprecedented levels of household debt, with some borrowers likely to be at risk in the event of a sharp downturn.  \par \par \uc2 The risks to New Zealand's financial system were growing, with the economy imbalanced after years of strong growth. It was well placed to weather any slowdown, although it might be tested if there was a sharp downturn.  \par \par \uc2 "All in all, the risk conditions facing the financial system over the next six months could be more testing than during the past six months," Bollard said in the six-monthly report.  \par \par \uc2 "We do not see those strains as spilling over to the financial system on a scale that would undermine its overall stability -- though specific stresses cannot be ruled out."  \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar <NZD=> \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had been functioning well, although turnover was expected to decrease as the economy slows and New Zealand's interest rate advantage over other countries narrows.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-NEWZEALAND-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ND|ABN|D|M|E|RBN|ABX|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051117e1bh002dg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
