\par\par \b \uc2 Bollard Says RBNZ Could Hold  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Position 5 Yrs Or More  \b0\par\par\uc2 430 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 2004\par 02:14\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of New Zealand would take a medium- to long-term view when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, potentially holding positions for five years or so, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Alan Bollard said Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard was speaking on National Radio after Tuesday's vote in New Zealand's Parliament ratifying a new funding agreement between the government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor.  \par \par \uc2 The agreement, which provides balance sheet firepower for the RBNZ to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, was passed by 84 votes to 35.  \par \par \uc2 The center-right National Party, led by Bollard's predecessor Don Brash, voted against ratification, as did the free-market Act Party.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would look to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar, known colloquially as the Kiwi, was a long way from its average medium-term level and that level wasn't justified by economic fundamentals.  \par \par \uc2 "We have been looking at getting this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  power for some time now. We see the opportunity to have a leveraged effect with a small real effect on the New Zealand dollar multiplying up to quite a significant effect across the economy," Bollard said.  \par \par \uc2 "I would expect other players to notice what we were doing and take similar action," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth the peaks and lessen the troughs of the New Zealand dollar's cycle, he said.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said he didn't expect to use the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  power much at all. "I won't be unhappy if I go through my term and don't use it," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard was appointed to a standard five-year term on Sept. 23, 2002.  \par \par \uc2 He expected the RBNZ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  practice would be nearest to the Australian model than to any other \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  model.  \par \par \uc2 "The Reserve Bank of Australia recently has had small success in taking the Australian dollar down from the top of its cycle and up from its bottom," Bollard said.  \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ wanted its own power to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  rather than using the Minister of Finance's power to instruct the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to undertake \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said the RBNZ over the next few months would lay out a framework publicly for its intended \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  practice.  \par \par \uc2 He said lobbying from sector groups in the economy over when and whether to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to influence the Kiwi was to be expected.  \par \par \uc2 -By John Barton, Dow Jones Newswires; 644 4715990; john.barton@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 07-04-04 0014GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040407e0470000g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
