\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Fin Min: RBNZ To Give  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Cost Annually  \b0\par\par\uc2 675 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 April 2004\par 06:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  will declare profits and losses from any \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its annual report, the finance minister told lawmakers Tuesday, in introducing amending legislation to boost the RBNZ's capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 The government is currently putting forward changes to the RBNZ's legislation aimed to enhance the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, through increases in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's equity and in its holding of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.  \par \par \uc2 "These measures will strengthen the bank's capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for two purposes," Finance Minister Michael Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 "The first is to stabilize the market in periods of market dysfunction such as when the market is very illiquid," he said.  \par \par \uc2 "The second is to reduce exchange rate variability, by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market where the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar exchange rate is either severely over or undervalued relative to economic fundamentals," Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 New Zealand's parliament is voting Tuesday on amendments to the Reserve Bank of New Zealand Act 1989, including the funding agreement between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government which sets the amount of income the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is allowed to retain to meet its \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  expenses.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said the main change to the funding agreement is that any market losses sustained by the Reserve Bank as a result of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market won't be treated as expenditure for the purpose of the funding agreement and won't cause the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to breach the maximum allowable expenditure under the agreement.  \par \par \uc2 Market losses on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions aren't part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  expenses, he said.  \par \par \uc2 "It is therefore appropriate that these expenses are not included in the funding agreement," Cullen said. "However, the bank will still be required to report any market losses in its statement of financial performance, in accordance with New Zealand accounting practice, and will still be accountable for all aspects of its financial performance and risk management."  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank provides a statement of its financial performance in its annual report.  \par \par \uc2 However, it acknowledges that positions taken by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to affect the value of the New Zealand dollar are likely to be inferred from the government's monthly accounts.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said it had been the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy for a long time to be ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the market for the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is dysfunctional.  \par \par \uc2 "The government has agreed to a substantial increase in the bank's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves for that purpose giving the bank access to around NZ$7 billion in reserves for market stability purposes," Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 The new policy is for the Reserve Bank to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce the peaks and troughs of the exchange rate cycle, Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 Since the New Zealand dollar was floated in March 1985, the Reserve Bank hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to influence the level of the exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said he has been advised by the Reserve Bank that a well-timed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, when the exchange rate is markedly over or undervalued relative to economic fundamentals, can help to diminish the peaks and troughs in the exchange rate cycle.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't expecting to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  often, and isn't promising that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will always succeed.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank is expected to say when it is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  most but not all of the time.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen also said that as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has itself made very clear, any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carries some element of financial risk. "The bank will almost inevitably carry market losses on its books from time to time, but these will generally be of an unrealized and non-permanent nature and are likely to reverse as the exchange rate cycle progresses."  \par \par \uc2 -By John Barton, Dow Jones Newswires; 644 4715990; john.barton@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Ryan Woo [ 06-04-04 0438GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040406e0460004r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
