\par\par \b \uc2 NZ govt seeks NZ$2.9 bln for RBNZ  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 23:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, March 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance minister said on Tuesday the government wanted to increase the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by NZ$1.9 billion and boost its capital by a further NZ$1 billion to allow it to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier this month the RBNZ said it would ask the government to give it the capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at times when the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar reached extreme and unjustifiable levels.  \par \par \uc2 However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would not target any particular level of the New Zealand dollar nor to go against the prevailing market trend.  \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Michael Cullen said in a statement that he had tabled a notice of motion to change the funding agreement between the RBNZ and the government.  \par \par \uc2 The package involved a NZ$1.9 billion increase to the bank's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, approval of further reserves to smooth the exchange rate cycle and an increase of NZ$1 billion in the bank's equity to assist it with the risks associated with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said in a statement.  \par \par \uc2 "These measures should assist the economy by tempering exchange rate volatility and will move New Zealand monetary management closer toward Australian practice," Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 ($1=NZ$1.54).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040329e03t002mn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
