\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Fin Min: RBNZ  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves To Be Raised To NZ$7B  \b0\par\par\uc2 346 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 23:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--New Zealand Finance Minister Michael Cullen said Tuesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fund for stabilizing the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during periods of dysfunction will be raised by NZ$1.9 billion to NZ$7 billion and further funds will be approved for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trim the peaks and troughs of the exchange rate cycle.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said in a statement that a notice of motion to ratify an amendment to the funding agreement between the Reserve Bank of New Zealand and the government will be introduced to parliament Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The finance minister also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's equity will be increased by about NZ$1 billion to help it cope with the risks associated with the new policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar market. [ 29-03-04 2152GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Earlier this month the Reserve Bank asked the government for greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to temper the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar's rise.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  holds reserves to calm the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during periods of extreme volatility but hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the local dollar was floated in 1985.  \par \par \uc2 The new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy increases the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's emergency \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and also gives it the capacity to buy or sell the New Zealand dollar when it is either exceptionally low or high relative to the level that economic fundamentals suggest it should be at.  \par \par \uc2 "These measures should assist the economy by tempering exchange rate volatility and will move New Zealand monetary management closer toward Australian practice," Cullen said.  \par \par \uc2 "They are strongly supported by the government as they are consistent with the changes we have introduced to monetary policy since taking office in 1999."  \par \par \uc2 Parliament is expected to ratify the change in policy as the left-wing Green Party has said it will vote with the minority Labour-led government on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue.  \par \par \uc2 -Wellington Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; djnews.wellington@dowjones.com [ 29-03-04 2203GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040329e03t00118\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
