\par\par \b \uc2 RBNZ repeats  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  stance.  \b0\par\par\uc2 353 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 03:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, March 25 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's plan to buy and sell the kiwi could make a small positive difference to the exchange rate cycle, the Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Deputy governor Adrian Orr said the proposed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime would not give relief from the general cycle which the New Zealand dollar undergoes.  \par \par \uc2 "We are not offering a panacea to these cycles, we are simply saying we think we can make a small positive difference that makes sense," Orr said in speech notes to a meat industry conference.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier this month the RBNZ asked the government for the capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets when the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar moves to extreme and unjustifiable levels out of touch with economic fundamentals.  \par \par \uc2 Orr repeated comments in a background paper released last week that the bank would not target a particular level of the New Zealand dollar, nor go against the tide of the market.  \par \par \uc2 "The Bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at opportune times, not when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's direction is being dominated by strong international trends or consensus opinions," Orr said.  \par \par \uc2 At best \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would likely only soften the extreme tops and bottoms of a cycle.  \par \par \uc2 Over the past three-and-a-half years the kiwi has touched a low of just below $0.39 in late 2000 and a high around $0.7100 in February.  \par \par \uc2 The kiwi dollar , which gained around 19 percent against the greenback over the past 12 months, last traded at $0.6485/95.  \par \par \uc2 Orr said the proposed system should not attract speculators to "take the Bank on", and the RBNZ believed the risks were relatively small and manageable.  \par \par \uc2 The plan to buy and sell New Zealand dollars made "good portfolio management sense" over the long term, Orr said.  \par \par \uc2 "On average over the medium term we anticipate having no exposure to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings."  \par \par \uc2 The bank currently has \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves of around NZ$3.5 billion ($2.3 billion), which it wants to increase but also reserve for extreme times when markets become "disorderly".  \par \par \uc2 ($1=NZ$1.54).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040325e03p000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
