\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Central Bk:  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Reserves To Be Increased Significantly  \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 03:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--Reserve Bank of New Zealand Deputy Governor Adrian Orr said Thursday that the bank will move to "significantly" increase \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves after Finance Minister Michael Cullen agreed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs a greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Orr, in notes for a speech to Meat New Zealand's annual conference in Whangarei, said more reserves appear necessary because the global \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has grown significantly since 1984 when the New Zealand dollar was floated.  \par \par \uc2 New Zealand's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves need to be sufficient to ensure the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can cope with extremely volatile market conditions when they occur, he said. "The Minister of Finance has agreed with our advice and will be moving to increase significantly the level of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves the bank will manage for such insurance purposes." [ 25-03-04 0217GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Orr reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also recently asked the government for greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar market when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is "exceptionally" high or low, relative to the level that economic fundamentals suggest it should be at.  \par \par \uc2 This type of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be aimed at "trimming the extreme tops and bottoms" of the New Zealand dollar exchange rate cycle, he said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't recommending a Bank of Japan-style of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Orr said, whereby Japanese policy-makers use significant funds with the aim of influencing the long-term trend of the yen or stand in the path of strong trends in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "What we are recommending is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the moment is justified and opportune," he said.  \par \par \uc2 -Wellington Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; djnews.wellington@dowjones.com [ 25-03-04 0231GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040325e03p0002h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
