\par\par \b \uc2 RBNZ says no NZ dlr level in mind,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  rare.   \b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 21:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, March 17 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would not target any particular level of exchange rate nor battle the market in the event it ever \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, according to a background paper released on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised last week when it said it would ask the government for the "capacity" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if the kiwi dollar reached unjustifiable levels that were not in tune with economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ said any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would occur only at the extremes of a exchange rate cycle and would be "opportunistic".   \par \par \uc2 The bank said it expected \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be infrequent.   \par \par \uc2 "We do not expect to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  very often or to be able to alter the exchange rate by a sufficiently large amount to make this a substantial issue," the paper said.   \par \par \uc2 "The Bank will not be attempting to stop the exchange rate moving when economic adjustment would be helped by that movement - we will not be targeting or defending any particular exchange rate," the bank said.   \par \par \uc2 It said it would not be taking on the market when investors and traders generally were moving in a particular direction, nor would it seek to "smooth out" the daily, weekly or even yearly movements in the exchange rate.   \par \par \uc2 "Such volatility is clearly a nuisance, but business can and do deal with that by hedging their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions."   \par \par \uc2 However, it said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be taken into account when it came to setting interest rates, which could see a "slightly smaller exchange rate cycle" offset by a "slightly greater inflation cycle or by a slightly greater interest rate cycle".   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar last traded at $0.6493 compared with Tuesday's late local level of around $0.6480/90.   \par \par \uc2 Since last week's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comments the kiwi has fallen more than nine percent on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comments combined with the RBNZ decision to keep interest rates on hold.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ said it will need a capital injection and increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to be able to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and absorb any losses incurred, which is why it needs the approval of the parliament.   \par \par \uc2 The bank currently has around NZ$3.5 billion in foreign cash reserves.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ already has the power to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  during times when financial markets are "disrupted" but has never done so since the New Zealand dollar was floated in early 1985.   \par \par \uc2 Bollard has said he did not see that the RBNZ would have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the kiwi's most recent cycle which has seen it appreciate from just below 39 U.S. cents in late-2000 to a peak of just over 71 cents in last month.   \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Michael Cullen has already thrown his backing behind the proposal.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040316e03g002tb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw1