\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: NZ Central Bk Won't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt Often  \b0\par\par\uc2 953 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 00:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 (Updates with details about proposed capital injection for Reserve Bank, Bollard's comments to parliament's finance committee, market reaction)  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar market to "ameliorate" extremes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could have significant benefits for the economy, the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday in a background paper on its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  proposal.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank stunned markets last week by announcing it has asked Finance Minister Michael Cullen for greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is unjustifiably low or high. That news sparked a 3% fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the U.S. dollar over 24 hours.  \par \par \uc2 The background paper said the New Zealand dollar varies across the economic cycle "to a far greater extent than the underlying economic situation warrants" and that the economic costs of such exchange rate distortions can be significant.  \par \par \uc2 "Successful \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would only ameliorate these distortions to a limited extent, but the benefits from doing so might be considerable," the bank said.  \par \par \uc2 "Our view is that there is likely to be a small benefit from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at dampening the exchange rate cycle, enough to outweigh the comparatively small risks of implementing the policy."  \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar last month hit a seven-year high of US$0.7102, which was a gain of 82% from its post-1985 float low of US$0.3898 in October 2000.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since the local dollar was floated nearly 20 years ago and its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves currently only total NZ$3.5 billion.  \par \par \uc2 The bank said selling New Zealand dollars when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is exceptionally high, or buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the other extreme, would "seem to" change monetary policy by altering the money supply, but added that any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be "sterilized" in line with international practice.  \par \par \uc2 "We do not expect to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  very often or be able to alter the exchange rate by a sufficiently large amount to make this (altering monetary policy) a substantial issue.  \par \par \uc2 "But to the extent that we are able to affect the path of the exchange rate through \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , that would be taken into account in our interest rate settings," the bank said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would give the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  a "small amount" of additional capacity to fulfill its Policy Targets Agreement with the government, which requires the bank to avoid unnecessary instability in interest rates, economic output and the exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar rose to US$0.6508 from US$0.6486 before release of the background paper because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's comments reassured investors that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't imminent.  \par \par \uc2 ANZ Bank director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets John Body said the Reserve Bank has signaled "a very pragmatic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy...it's going to be economically very valid and based on long analysis."  \par \par \uc2 Capital Injection Required  \par \par \uc2 The background paper reiterated last Thursday's statement by Reserve Bank Governor Alan Bollard in which he said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be aimed at extremes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and wouldn't be used to fight the New Zealand dollar's prevailing trend.  \par \par \uc2 "We will not be attempting to slow or reverse the exchange rate's movement when a large number of investors and traders are convinced that the exchange rate is going to continue to move in the same direction," the paper said.  \par \par \uc2 Nor will the bank be targeting any particular level of the New Zealand dollar and nor will it attempt to "smooth out" day-to-day or week-to-week volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be opportunistic, rather than a 'come what may' stand in the market against the odds," the bank said.  \par \par \uc2 The paper said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would expose the bank to changes in the value of the New Zealand dollar, but "the proposed strategy is in fact likely to be profitable to the Reserve Bank over the medium term, as long as the exchange rate continues to show a cyclical pattern."  \par \par \uc2 In the short to medium term it is probable there will be "substantial" unrealized gains and losses in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading," the paper said.  \par \par \uc2 "It would be desirable that any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy enjoyed multiparty support in Parliament, to minimize the risk that a policy u-turn might cause marked-to-market accounting losses to become real losses," the bank said.  \par \par \uc2 The left-wing Green party has said it will vote with the Labour-led minority coalition government on the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , providing a majority in parliament for the policy change. Giving the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only requires ratification in parliament, not a law change.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank of New Zealand will need a capital injection from the government to give it greater capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Bollard told parliament's finance and expenditure select committee Wednesday morning that increasing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves will take two forms.  \par \par \uc2 First, current reserves, which the bank can use to calm extremely volatile market conditions, will be increased to make the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  more effective in that area, and these reserves will be ring-fenced from other reserves.  \par \par \uc2 Second, the capital injection will be used for reserves to implement the new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, to be operated under Section 16 of the Reserve Bank Act, which allows the bank to deal in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  independently of the government.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has given the government a proposal about what its reserves should be increased to, but declined to reveal the amount.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stephen Wright, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; stephen.wright@dowjones.com [ 16-03-04 2327GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040316e03g000zv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
