\par\par \b \uc2 NZ's Bollard: Doesn't See  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  In Near Future  \b0\par\par\uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 18:40\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Alan Bollard said Friday that he doesn't expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in the near future and reiterated that he is seeking the capacity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the local dollar is exceptionally high.  \par \par \uc2 "We are seeking a capacity. We are not necessarily looking to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  or certainly not in the near future," Bollard told TV One's morning business news program.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank Thursday asked Finance Minister Michael Cullen to be allowed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar when it is "unjustifiably" low or high, helping to spark a 3% fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "We are seeking the capacity (to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) because when we see the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar going to very high levels, or exceptionally high levels, if that there were to happen, then we feel we could use an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  capacity potentially as supplementary to the normal interest rate used for monetary policy," Bollard said.  \par \par \uc2 "And in saying that, we don't expect to have a major effect in the level of the (New Zealand) dollar. It could be quite a minor effect. It may very well never happen," he said. [ 11-03-04 1756GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said news reports that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seeking permission from the government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  are incorrect as it already has authority to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  under the Reserve Bank Act.  \par \par \uc2 "What we are doing is seeking to ensure that we have got the right balance sheet structure, to be able to credibly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , should that ever be necessary, but as I say it may never be," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard denied that the bank is using rhetoric about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a psychological tool to drag the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar lower.  \par \par \uc2 "No we're not playing with a psychological tool and I wouldn't comment on any particular moves overnight some of which may be short-term features anyway.  \par \par \uc2 "We are looking to have a capability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  should the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar ever get to a situation where it's so far away from economic fundamentals that it's unjustifiably exceptionally far, and the level of that could actually be damaging to the real sector," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar is trading around US$0.6470 in early local trade Friday compared with US$0.6685 early Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard wouldn't say what level of the New Zealand dollar he would regard as exceptionally high.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier this week Finance Minister Michael Cullen said the New Zealand dollar is overvalued, which if sustained, could cause lasting damage to the country's export sector.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stephen Wright, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; stephen.wright@dowjones.com [ 11-03-04 1815GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040311e03b000um\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
