\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Central Bk May Have  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Power Within Weeks  \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 03:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could have the power to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets within a matter of weeks as the proposed change in the near 20-year policy of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  requires only Cabinet approval and ratification by parliament, rather than a new law.  \par \par \uc2 A spokeswoman for Finance Minister Michael Cullen Thursday told Dow Jones Newswires that the change in policy will require parliament to vote on a "government notice of motion" that proposes a change to the funding agreement between the government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  under section 161 of the Reserve Bank Act.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier Thursday the Reserve Bank said it has asked Cullen for authority to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in situations where the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is "unjustifiably" low or high.  \par \par \uc2 Cullen responded by saying he strongly supports the Reserve Bank having a more active role in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and expects to take a proposal, incorporating the Reserve Bank's advise, to Cabinet in the "near future."  \par \par \uc2 The left-wing Green Party said its nine lawmakers will support the government on the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , giving the minority Labour-led administration, which has 52 lawmakers, a majority for the change in New Zealand's 120-member parliament.  \par \par \uc2 Though one of Labour's lawmakers is the Speaker of the House of Representatives, who chairs parliament's debates and normally doesn't vote, he can cast a vote when there is a deadlock.  \par \par \uc2 Also, the centrist New Zealand First party, which has 13 lawmakers, has in the past made statements supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and is likely to support the government motion.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stephen Wright, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; stephen.wright@dowjones.com [ 11-03-04 0241GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040311e03b00035\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
