\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex intervention \highlight\uc2  may never happen-RBNZ's Bollard.  \b0\par\par\uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 21:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, March 12 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  may never \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to alter the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar but needs the resources to do so if necessary, governor Alan Bollard said on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised the previous day when it said it would ask the government for the "capacity" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if the kiwi dollar reached unjustifiable levels that were not in tune with economic fundamentals.  \par \par \uc2 The statement, which was quickly embraced by Finance Minister Michael Cullen, compounded a sell off a two percent in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 However, Bollard said the RBNZ's move was technical in nature and aimed at ensuring the bank had the balance sheet to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, should that ever become necessary.  \par \par \uc2 "What we are saying to the government is not give us the power - we've got that power - it is to ensure that we have the balance sheet required to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  credibly," Bollard told Radio \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , adding that the RBNZ already had the legal power to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "What we are talking about is a capability - it is not necessarily an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - it may never happen," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Bollard said the RBNZ would not be looking at large scale \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  used, for example, by the Bank of Japan, and reiterated that such \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be more in the style of the Reserve Bank of Australia's.  \par \par \uc2 Overnight, the New Zealand dollar continued its slide touching a low of US$0.6420 , a slide of more than two percent on the late local price.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has fallen more than three percent in the past 24 hours, wiping out its appreciation since the start of the year, in the wake of the bank's decision to leave its official cash rate at 5.25 percent and after its comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Former Reserve Bank governor and now leader of the opposition National Party Don Brash confirmed the bank, under his charge, had looked carefully at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over a number of years and had raised the possibility in 2000.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank bank has never \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the market since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985.  \par \par \uc2 Brash said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried with it risks to the bank's balance sheet and the taxpayer.  \par \par \uc2 Likewise there were risks of higher interest rates if the bank moved to knock the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down.  \par \par \uc2 "The other risk that this will suddenly put an end to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility and in fact it won't," Brash said.  \par \par \uc2 If the Reserve Bank were to be successful in getting the exchange rate down, then the inevitable consequence of that would be higher interest rates, he said.  \par \par \uc2 "I suspect that if the governor had known when he made his interest rate speech that the exchange rate rate would come down by two or three cents and stay down, I suspect he might well have increased the cash rate yesterday," Brash said.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040311e03b0031z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
