\par\par \b \uc2 NZ's Green Party To Vote For Govt  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Policy  \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 00:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Green Party said Thursday it will vote for a policy allowing the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, giving the minority Labour government a majority in parliament for the policy change.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank of New Zealand earlier Thursday said it has asked Finance Minister Michael Cullen to be allowed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar when it is unjustifiably low or high.  \par \par \uc2 "Any mechanism that gets the New Zealand dollar down to a realistic level is worth supporting and therefore we intend to vote for the proposed motion to change the Reserve Bank's funding agreement," the Green party said in a statement  \par \par \uc2 Cullen said earlier Thursday that a Cabinet paper incorporating the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's advise is being drafted and will be presented to the Cabinet of government ministers in the near future.  \par \par \uc2 The change in policy after 20 years of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  requires a motion in parliament but new legislation isn't required.  \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand First Party has also indicated in the past that it would support some form of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  